### ✅ What Works

| Component | Status | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Electron scaffold | ✅ Working | electron-vite + React + TypeScript boots correctly |
| Build pipeline | ✅ Working | `npm run build` succeeds, portable build scripts exist |
| `/dist/` compiled JSONs | ✅ Complete | All 10 artifacts compiled correctly from SKILL.md |
| Basic OCR wrapper | ⚠️ Partial | Tesseract.js wrapper exists but no pre-processing pipeline |
| Table parser | ⚠️ Partial | Regex-based, no bank layout detection |
| Classification service | ⚠️ Partial | Entity + keyword lookup works, but missing steps 3-5 of decision tree |
| Analysis service | ⚠️ Minimal | Only totals + category sums — 3 of 17 required metrics |
| Projection service | ❌ Stub | Hardcoded linear math with mock data — not SARIMA |
| Reporting service | ❌ Stub | JSON dump only — no sections, no disclaimer template |
| Agent API | ❌ Stub | Single `/api/transactions` endpoint that reads files |
| UI/UX | ❌ Basic | Unstyled default Electron; no design system |

### ❌ What's Completely Missing

| Component | Spec Reference | Impact |
|---|---|---|
| **Persona system** (personal/business/offshore) | SKILL.md Part 8 pre-flight | **Critical** — the entire app hinges on entity context |
| **Data persistence layer** | RESUME.md #5 | No database, no write-back — everything is in-memory only |
| **OCR pre-processing** (grayscale, deskew, denoise, binarise, upscale) | Part 2.2 | Images will OCR poorly without this |
| **Bank layout detection** (SCB/MCB/Nouvobanq column mapping) | Part 2.3 | Table parser guesses instead of detecting |
| **Recurrence detection** | Part 1.3, Step 3 | No recurring transaction detection |
| **Special flags** (round amounts, FX, short descriptions) | Part 1.3, Step 4 | Not implemented |
| **Balance validation** | Part 7.1, CHECK 01 | Running balance check is missing |
| **Macro indicator fetch/cache** | Part 4.3 | Fetch decision tree exists in spec but not in code |
| **SARIMA projection engine** | Part 4.1 | Replaced with `lastValue * (1 + 0.01 * i)` |
| **Sector seasonality adjustment** | Part 3.3 | Not applied to any analysis or projection |
| **Report generation** (PDF/XLSX) | Parts 6 + 7 | Only JSON dump exists |
| **Review queue** | Part 1.3, RULE 06 | No human-in-the-loop for low-confidence transactions |
| **Entity management UI** | RESUME.md #3 | No way to add/edit entities from the app |
| **Pre-flight checklist** | Part 8 | Never triggered before operations |
| **Tax rate verification** | Part 1.6 | `verified_date` is null, no check is performed |
| **Mandatory disclaimer** | Part 7.2 | Hardcoded partial text in ProjectionView, not from `rules_reporting.json` |
| **Privacy/consent flow** | Part 2.2 | No opt-in for cloud OCR, no data handling consent |
| **CSS design system** | — | 290 lines of basic utility CSS, no design tokens, no dark mode |

