## Architecture Assessment

### What the Spec Intended vs What Was Built

```
INTENDED (SKILL.md Part 5.2):          BUILT:
/app                                   /src
├── /ingestion   (4 modules)           ├── /main        (1 file: index.ts)
├── /classification (4 modules)        ├── /preload      (1 file: boilerplate)
├── /analysis    (4 modules)           └── /renderer
├── /projections (4 modules)               ├── /components (3 files)
├── /reporting   (5 modules)               └── /services   (6 files, all stubs)
└── /config      (→ /dist/ JSONs)
```

**20+ modules** were specified. **6 stub services** were delivered.

---

## Recovery Plan — Phased Approach

### Phase 1: Foundation Reset (Priority: NOW)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Do these before writing any feature code.

| Task | Description |
|---|---|
| **1.1 Data layer** | Add SQLite (via `better-sqlite3`) for transaction and entity persistence |
| **1.2 Persona system** | Create entity profiles (personal/business/offshore) with CRUD |
| **1.3 IPC bridge** | Wire preload.ts with proper IPC channels for file system, DB, and API access |
| **1.4 Design system** | Replace the 290-line CSS with a proper dark-mode design system |
| **1.5 Navigation** | Add sidebar navigation with persona selector, not just 4 buttons |

### Phase 2: Core Pipeline (Priority: HIGH)

| Task | Description |
|---|---|
| **2.1 OCR pipeline** | Implement the full pre-processing chain from Part 2.2 |
| **2.2 Bank layout detection** | Implement column detection algorithm from Part 2.3 |
| **2.3 Complete classification** | Implement all 5 steps of the decision tree |
| **2.4 Review queue** | Build the human-in-the-loop review UI for low-confidence transactions |
| **2.5 Decimal math** | Replace all `parseFloat` with proper decimal handling |

### Phase 3: Intelligence Layer (Priority: HIGH)

| Task | Description |
|---|---|
| **3.1 Full analysis engine** | Implement all 17 metrics (8 individual + 9 org) |
| **3.2 NBS benchmarking** | Wire up household benchmarks from `rules_analysis.json` |
| **3.3 Seasonality** | Apply sector seasonality indices from Part 3.3 |
| **3.4 Projection engine** | Implement SARIMA or equivalent time-series forecasting |
| **3.5 Macro indicator fetch** | Implement the fetch decision tree from Part 4.3 |

### Phase 4: Reporting & API (Priority: MEDIUM)

| Task | Description |
|---|---|
| **4.1 Report generator** | Build structured reports per Parts 6.1 and 6.2 |
| **4.2 PDF export** | Integrate a PDF renderer (html-pdf or similar) |
| **4.3 Quality checks** | Implement all 7 checks from Part 7.1 |
| **4.4 Agent API** | Build the full REST API from Part 5.3 |
| **4.5 Pre-flight checklist** | Implement the Part 8 checklist as an onboarding flow |

### Phase 5: Polish & Ship (Priority: MEDIUM)

| Task | Description |
|---|---|
| **5.1 Entity management UI** | Full CRUD for entities with write-back to entities.json/DB |
| **5.2 Tax rate verification** | Warn when `verified_date` is stale |
| **5.3 Privacy consent flow** | OCR provider selection (local vs cloud) with explicit opt-in |
| **5.4 Dashboard** | Interactive charts, drill-down, period selection |
| **5.5 Testing** | Expand beyond the single TableParser test |

