## Verdict

> [!CAUTION]
> **Completion estimate: ~15-20% of the spec is implemented.** The compiled `/dist/` artifacts are solid. The Electron scaffold is usable. Everything else needs to be built properly from the ground up.

The `SKILL.md` and `bootstrap_prompt.txt` are genuinely excellent work — the domain knowledge base is comprehensive, the compilation architecture is clever, and the Seychelles context is deeply researched. The previous AI just didn't follow through on the implementation. The app currently looks and behaves like a basic Electron boilerplate with some hardcoded demo logic bolted on.

**The spec is the asset. The code needs a rebuild.**
